# Keep the build context (and, more importantly, every image layer) free of
# anything not needed to build the wheel or run the container (Lot 16b,
# docs/refactoring-plan.md). The 128MB .claude/research-papers/ corpus in
# particular must never end up in a distributed image.

.git/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

.claude/
.github/
docs/
tests/
examples/
benchmarks/
scripts/

*.md
!README.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.env
.env.*
